  "body": "This allows the preload spec to delegate to HTML's \"obtain the resource\"\r\nalgorithm for <link> elements, instead of creating a copy of it. The\r\nlatter approach has been attempted, but got out of date very quickly;\r\nsee https://github.com/w3c/preload/pull/91 for more details.\r\n\r\n/cc @yoavweiss",
